              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, pilum, large shield. Light armour +2. Manipular Unit. May be Drilled (+2). One unit of Hastati for each unit of Principes. A unit of this type may have a Leader, Standard Bearer and Musician at no cost. (Hannibal p.57)</characteristic>
