              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, thrusting spear, large shield. Manipular Unit. One unit of Principes for each unit of Triarii (two units of Principes per Triarii after the legion reorganisation). A unit of this type may have a Leader, Standard Bearer and Musician at no cost. (Hannibal p.57)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="064c-0c71-3b69-fc32" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
