              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">No more than one elephant model regardless of army size. Unarmed mahout and two crew with javelins in a fighting tower (5+ save). Up to ten escorts (Light Infantry), up to half with sling and buckler, the rest javelin and buckler; escorts may not have leader, standard bearer or musician; escorts touching an enemy model may fight if they join the engaged elephant. Elephant: may stampede; causes fear in infantry and terror in cavalry. (Hannibal p.61)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="1b9a-1cdd-4009-d2ca" name="Sling" hidden="true" targetId="7ff2-453d-751e-5f78" type="profile">
